* ''Placement over patterns'' (operator, 2026-11-09, the placement leap). Where a record rests decides where it reaches disk: a record projects by the bag that holds it and that bag's mirror grant, never by its title or a field it carries; a record that must stay off disk rests where no mirror reaches (the control document, the secret home, the shadow layer, a board no recipe mounts). <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/api/disk-projection#/projection-filter`>>; `tools/placement-residency-witness.mjs` reads it.

